 "description": "This is the Third deck of four. The first four I've made in nearly 3 years.",
 "strategy": "the first thing you do is pull ECHO DOCKING BAY out with IMPERIAL ARREST ORDER. Try to flip the objective with in 2 to 3 turns (it can be done). spread out your agents on HOTH and drain like hell. Use PRESENCE OF THE FORCE on locations you need an icon and put EXPAND THE EMPIRE on the DEFENCEIVE PERIMETER. When draining with MAUL'S lightsaber lose a PROBE DROID so you can keep retiving it and bring it in to hand with PEITT. Keep your fleet at HOTH to keep REBEL BASE OCCUPATION going except The IMPERIAL-CALSS STAR DESTROYER, deploy that on CORUSCANT to drain there. Use MERREJK to pull out HOTH if your not drawing it. Last but not least DRAW LIKE HELL, and use REACTOR TRMINAL. If played right not only can this be a fast deck but you can drain up to 20+ force a turn.",
